{"id":"n38680-2-7","stage":4,"title":"기어가다 · 爬行","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n38680-2-7-1","ko":"차들이 엉금엉금 기어가네요.","zh":"车子开得这么慢，像是在爬行一样。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"차들이","meaning":"车，车辆","explanation":"차：车，车辆；들：复数后缀，表示多个对象。；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"차","audio":"/audio/6ccd3f82b0317e51da2a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62525","senseId":"1","lemma":"차","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"엉금엉금","meaning":"慢慢腾腾地，慢慢呑呑地","explanation":"엉금엉금：慢慢腾腾地，慢慢呑呑地","readings":[{"term":"엉금엉금","audio":"/audio/4b856b9e4eba3d1e3e07.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67426","senseId":"1","lemma":"엉금엉금","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"기어가네요.","meaning":"爬行，慢行","explanation":"기어가다：爬行，慢行；네요：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，礼貌句末。","readings":[{"term":"기어가다","audio":"/audio/02888d06e80534e4f856.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"38680","senseId":"2","lemma":"기어가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"6ccd3f82b0317e51","term":"차","zh":"车，车辆","audio":"/audio/6ccd3f82b0317e51da2a.mp3","entryId":"62525","definition":"搬运人或行李的带轮子的机械。","pronunciation":["차"]},{"id":"4b856b9e4eba3d1e","term":"엉금엉금","zh":"慢慢腾腾地，慢慢呑呑地","audio":"/audio/4b856b9e4eba3d1e3e07.mp3","entryId":"67426","definition":"以大动作缓慢走路或爬行的样子。","pronunciation":["엉그멍금"]},{"id":"02888d06e80534e4","term":"기어가다","zh":"爬行，慢行","audio":"/audio/02888d06e80534e4f856.mp3","entryId":"38680","definition":"汽车等非常缓慢地前行。","pronunciation":["기어가다","기여가다"]}],"audio":"/audio/67b5c8bbfa1aa45386c1.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n38680-2-7-2","ko":"네. 안개가 너무 짙어서 빨리 갈 수가 없어요.","zh":"是的，雾太浓了，所以没办法开得快。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"네.","meaning":"是，是的，哎","explanation":"네：是，是的，哎","readings":[{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17294","senseId":"1","lemma":"네","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"안개가","meaning":"雾，雾气","explanation":"안개：雾，雾气；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"안개","audio":"/audio/b70164aa8123e15aa7fa.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14777","senseId":"1","lemma":"안개","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"너무","meaning":"太","explanation":"너무：太","readings":[{"term":"너무","audio":"/audio/b0398672877079631cf2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28183","senseId":"1","lemma":"너무","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"짙어서","meaning":"浓，厚","explanation":"짙다：浓，厚；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"짙다","audio":"/audio/534980e3f6bb292a26ba.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71362","senseId":"4","lemma":"짙다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"빨리","meaning":"快，赶快","explanation":"빨리：快，赶快","readings":[{"term":"빨리","audio":"/audio/a5443c04aa0fdc08a00a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57305","senseId":"1","lemma":"빨리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"갈","meaning":"去，开往，飞向","explanation":"가다：去，开往，飞向；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"가다","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27500","senseId":"2","lemma":"가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"수가","meaning":"可以，可能","explanation":"수：可以，可能；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"수","audio":"/audio/dcd19f5b5caac9771378.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15615","senseId":"1","lemma":"수","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"없어요.","meaning":"不能（-ㄹ/을 수 없다）","explanation":"없다：不能（-ㄹ/을 수 없다）；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"없다","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89917","senseId":"11","lemma":"없다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"1c0ddfd005093840","term":"네","zh":"是，是的，哎","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3","entryId":"17294","definition":"用于回应长辈的呼叫。","pronunciation":["네"]},{"id":"b70164aa8123e15a","term":"안개","zh":"雾，雾气","audio":"/audio/b70164aa8123e15aa7fa.mp3","entryId":"14777","definition":"接近地面的水蒸气，遇冷凝结后飘浮在空气中的小水点。","pronunciation":["안ː개"]},{"id":"b039867287707963","term":"너무","zh":"太","audio":"/audio/b0398672877079631cf2.mp3","entryId":"28183","definition":"已超过一定的程度或限度的状态。","pronunciation":["너무"]},{"id":"534980e3f6bb292a","term":"짙다","zh":"浓，厚","audio":"/audio/534980e3f6bb292a26ba.mp3","entryId":"71362","definition":"雾气或烟等密度高。","pronunciation":["짇따"]},{"id":"a5443c04aa0fdc08","term":"빨리","zh":"快，赶快","audio":"/audio/a5443c04aa0fdc08a00a.mp3","entryId":"57305","definition":"花费的时间不长地。","pronunciation":["빨리"]},{"id":"233cb510410b09d6","term":"가다","zh":"去，开往，飞向","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3","entryId":"27500","definition":"船、飞机、汽车等去往某个地方。","pronunciation":["가다"]},{"id":"dcd19f5b5caac977","term":"수","zh":"可以，可能","audio":"/audio/dcd19f5b5caac9771378.mp3","entryId":"15615","definition":"做某事的能力，或某事发生的可能性。","pronunciation":["수"]},{"id":"815560dcd5b82893","term":"없다","zh":"不能（-ㄹ/을 수 없다）","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3","entryId":"89917","definition":"不能（-ㄹ/을 수 없다）","pronunciation":["업ː따"]}],"audio":"/audio/025a90ed54a63d4a263d.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.036,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=38680","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"2","sourceLevel":"고급","day":144,"sequenceScore":2.8627,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["是的，雾太浓了，所以没办法开得快。","那只小狗从哪儿过去了？","车子开得这么慢，像是在爬行一样。"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["是的，雾太浓了，所以没办法开得快。","车子开得这么慢，像是在爬行一样。","那只小狗从哪儿过去了？"],"answer":0}]}
